{"version":1,"content":"<p>政府會修改《競爭條例》，將樓宇大型維修工程圍標行為列為刑事罪行，並會將新刑事罪行納入《有組織及嚴重罪行條例》下的指定罪行。</p><p>競委會行政總裁畢仲明說，會盡快到立法會討論相關修例建議，之後會再諮詢持分者，爭取明年4月前通過修例。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:43:45.330182+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:01:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:38:52.645239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:38:54.952721+00:00","content_hash":"d4083df47f75113bd9d82e3d3589b4b032b2775f194b955dda8f1df365afcc5e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}